<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>青少年训练 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%9D%92%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83/</link><description>Recent content in 青少年训练 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%9D%92%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>教别人打球：带朋友的孩子练球、纠正动作与家长沟通</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/coaching-and-teaching/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/coaching-and-teaching/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇按&lt;strong&gt;从家长开口请托到训练结束复盘&lt;/strong&gt;的顺序，拆成五个细化场景：朋友在后院请你带他儿子练球、第一次训练先热身再把基本功变成游戏、篮下纠正投篮动作、家长在场边插话怎么接、结束后跟家长交代今天练了什么。主角是打过球的你，朋友是 Ben，他九岁的儿子是 Jake，妈妈是 Rachel。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>